32:41.430 --> 32:42.490
Cepat masuk, mari.

32:43.640 --> 32:44.880
Ada pula dua buah katil.

32:44.280 --> 32:46.540
♪ Jangan fikirkan hari keesokan ♪

32:44.910 --> 32:46.570
