33:23.320 --> 33:24.320
Si anjing.

33:25.000 --> 33:26.450
♪ Apabila waktu subuh ♪

33:25.230 --> 33:26.470
Si anjing.

33:26.640 --> 33:27.430
Kamu berdua

33:27.430 --> 33:28.310
begitu muda,

33:28.430 --> 33:29.860
